{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>對於想要快速將相片與影片剪輯成專業級作品、又不想學習複雜軟體的人來說，Video Maker Pro 提供了一站式解決方案。無論是製作婚禮紀念、旅行回顧還是社群媒體短片，這款 App 都能讓你在幾分鐘內產出高品質成果。目前它正處於限時免費狀態，原價 US $3.99，現在即可免費下載。</p>\n\n<h2>輕鬆打造專業幻燈片</h2>\n<p>Video Maker Pro 的核心功能是將相片結合成帶有音樂與轉場特效的幻燈片影片。你只需選取照片，App 便會自動套用多種主題與流暢的過場動畫，並可自由調整每張圖片的顯示時間。此外，內建的影片編輯器支援剪裁、合併多個片段，還能加入文字、貼圖與濾鏡，讓成品更具個人風格。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-75-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-76-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-77-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-78-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-79-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1320x2868bb-80-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Video Maker Pro – Slideshow</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T16:58:26.878234+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":358,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}